  <description>Raspberry Pi Camera Module 3 (standard, Sony IMX708), matching the physical hardware used for downward ArUco precision-landing detection. horizontal_fov (66 deg) and 1280x720 output resolution match the real libcamerasrc GStreamer pipeline in sensors/mono_cam.py and the ROS topic in perception/aruco_detector.py.</description>
